{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cozy idle cafe management game that runs at the bottom of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and manage your dream farm &amp; cafe without interrupting your day! Design a charming restaurant, hire an adorable staff, and grow fresh ingredients on your very own farm. Cook and serve delicious dishes while focusing on other tasks.<br><br><strong>Now with Twitch &amp; YouTube integration!!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/Streaming.gif?t=1746857186\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Twitch &amp; Streaming integration</strong></u> <br>Connect to your stream and let chat join your cafe and become your customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Build your dream cafe</u></strong> <br>Design, decorate, and customize your perfect cafe to match your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Grow Fresh Ingredients</u> </strong> <br>Plant and harvest crops from your little farm to create the freshest meals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/0329.gif?t=1746857186\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Cook &amp; Serve</u> </strong> <br>Turn fresh ingredients into delicious meals and earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Grow Your Business</u> </strong> <br>Reinvest your earnings to upgrade your cafe and expand your farm.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/0329__3__1_.gif?t=1746857186\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Playing while working</u></strong> <br>Your friendly staff will take care of the cafe, keeping things running smoothly while you work, study, or relax.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/0329__2__5_.gif?t=1746857186\" /> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Send presents to your friends</strong></u><br>Send fresh ingredients from your farm to your IRL friend via postal service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break, sip your coffee, and let your cafe flourish.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3167540?t=1746857186","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/cc3e3cd020dc5674fd05b1ee253886f9fab34ada/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746857186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/73f7839d9e3d86a20f3132efc81a0abf4a02945c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746857186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/73f7839d9e3d86a20f3132efc81a0abf4a02945c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746857186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cozy idle cafe management game that runs at the bottom of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and manage your dream farm &amp; cafe without interrupting your day! Design a charming restaurant, hire an adorable staff, and grow fresh ingredients on your very own farm. Cook and serve delicious dishes while focusing on other tasks.<br><br><strong>Now with Twitch &amp; YouTube integration!!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_